<file path="docs/commands/expose.mdx">
---
title: Expose Command
---

`/exposure expose <capture_properties>` - Creates an exposure. [Capture Parameters](../customization/components/capture_parameters)

#### Example:
`/exposure expose {}` - default exposure.\
`/exposure expose {shutter_speed:"1/10", color_palette:"exposure:map_colors"}` - Brighter image. Using built in map_colors palette.
</file>

<file path="docs/commands/load.mdx">
---
title: Load Command
---

`/exposure load <capture_properties>` - loads an image from a file or URL.\
*projection* property of [Capture Parameters](../customization/components/capture_parameters) must be specified.

#### Example:
`/exposure load {projection:{path:"D:/images/cat.png"}}`

