      <span style={{ color: '#63b3eb', fontSize: '15px' }}>• Hovering over parts of the camera will show tooltip with additional information.\
                                                           • Clicking on the Lens or Filter parts will show all available items for the attachment.\
                                                           • You can quickly insert/swap an attachment by right-clicking the camera in GUI with item.</span>
    </div>
</div>

When Film is loaded, *use* the **Camera** to look through **Viewfinder**

<div style={{ textAlign: "center" }}>
<Asset location="exposure:viewfinder" width={500} title="Viewfinder Controls" style={{ textAlign: "center" }}/>
*Pressing/holding sneak or middle mouse button shows **Camera Controls***
</div>

## Camera Controls
- Shutter Speed - *(brightens or darkens the image)*
- Composition Guide
- Self-Timer *Off/1/2/5/10 seconds* - *(when ticking, nearby entities will be attracted by the noise, and will look at the camera)*
- [Flash](attachments/flash) *on/off/auto* (if installed)

<div name='INFO' style={{ display: 'inline-block', margin: '2px' }}>
    <div style={{ display: 'flex', alignItems: 'top', backgroundColor: '#21252b', borderRadius: '6px', padding: '8px 12px' }}>
